evelopment Career Development Chicago 09/04/2026 Administrative The Coordinator of Career Advising & Professional Development provides direct career advising, career education, mentoring, and professional development support to Roosevelt University students. The coordinator maintains an active advising caseload, manages the Professional Mentoring Program (PMP) and dayto-day administration of the PeopleGrove platform, and serves as the Office of Career S... View Details Bookmark Payroll Manager Office of the Chief Hum Res Officer Hybrid - Chicago 09/03/2026 Administrative The Payroll Manager leads payroll operations and ensures accurate, timely, and compliant processing of the University’s biweekly and monthly payrolls. This role oversees payroll processing, tax reporting, reconciliations, systems, audits, and employee support while partnering with HR, Finance, Financial Aid, and departments to improve controls, processes, and service.The Payroll Manager reports... View Details Bookmark Graduate Admission Counselor - Heller College of Business Office of Enrollment Services Hybrid - Chicago 08/25/2026 Administrative Do you enjoy helping prospective students explore their goals and identify the graduate program that can help them get there? Are you energized by relationship building, problem solving, and working collaboratively to grow enrollment? Roosevelt University, with campuses in downtown Chicago and Schaumburg, is seeking a Graduate Admission Counselor supporting the Heller College of Business. This ... View Details Bookmark Program Coordinator, Reentry Support Institute Reentry Support Institute Chicago 08/25/2026 Administrative The Reentry Support Institute within Roosevelt University is committed to helping previously incarcerated citizens return to community and family life. Through annual grants, the Reentry Support Institute contracts with the Illinois Department of Corrections (IDOC) to change the lives of returning citizens by providingThe Program Coordinator provides primary support to the Director of Administr... View Details Bookmark Individual Giving Manager, Auditorium Theatre Office of ATRU Development Chicago 08/24/2026 Administrative The Auditorium is a National Historic Landmark and a leading performing arts venue committed to presenting the finest in international, cultural, community, and educational programming. We are dedicated to fostering artistic excellence, expanding access to the arts, and supporting the vibrant cultural landscape of Chicago. Our team is passionate, mission-driven, and united in the belief that th... View Details Bookmark Assistant Registrar for Degree Conferral & Graduation Operations Registrar's Office Hybrid - Chicago 08/14/2026 Administrative The Assistant Registrar for Degree Conferral and Graduation Operations manages and optimizes the full degree-conferral lifecycle, including graduation application processing, degree clearance, diploma production and commencement coordination in conjunction with the Office of Conference Services. The role ensures efficient workflows, high data integrity, and proactive monitoring of system update... View Details Bookmark Executive Secretary Heller College of Buisness Office of the Dean, Heller College of Business Chicago 08/12/2026 Clerical The Heller College of Business at Roosevelt University is seeking a dynamic and organized individual to serve as the Executive Secretary to the Dean/Director of MBIRE. This role is pivotal in ensuring smooth operations within the College, providing comprehensive administrative and communication support to the Dean, Assistant and Associate Deans, and serving as the first point of contact for fac... View Details Bookmark Athletics Admission Counselor Office of Enrollment Services Hybrid - Chicago 07/30/2026 Administrative Do you love discussing goals and possibilities with prospective student-athletes? Do you enjoy problem solving and working in a collaborative team setting? Are you interested in building a professional network across a university, and at schools across Chicago-land? If so, Roosevelt University is seeking an Athletic Admission Counselor who will help us to identify and recruit the next class of ... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor - Computer Science and Cybersecurity (CST 250) Computer Science Chicago 07/14/2026 Adjunct Reflecting the ideals of its founders in 1945, Roosevelt University is a private, nonsectarian community of educators, scholars and learners committed to academic, creative and service excellence, who value differences in personal experiences and perspectives; ask difficult questions; and promote mutual understanding, inclusion, social consciousness and action toward social justice. Recognizing... View Details Bookmark Anatomy and Physiology Instructor Biology Chicago 07/09/2026 Full-Time Faculty Roosevelt University’s College of Science, Health and Pharmacy seeks to fill a full-time, non-tenure-track faculty position on a 9-month renewable contract, beginning August 2026.GENERAL RESPONSIBILITIES: The primary responsibility of this position is to provide in-person lecture and laboratory instruction in Anatomy and Physiology courses for health science majors. Class assignments may includ... View Details Bookmark HR Generalist, Academic Systems and Compensation Office of Compensation Bene & Tech Hybrid - Chicago 06/24/2026 Administrative The Human Resources Generalist, Academic Systems & Compensation, has a portfolio that includes responsibilities in compensation and HR Tech. This includes, but is not limited to, managing and implementing part-time faculty employment and pay; managing part-time collective bargaining agreement pay changes in the Banner HRIS; supporting data and access requests; assisting with Banner maintena... View Details Bookmark Clinical Faculty, Physician Assistant Studies Program Office of the Dean,Coll of Science, Health & Pharmacy Schaumburg 06/28/2026 Full-Time Faculty Roosevelt University, College of Science, Health and Pharmacy, Schaumburg, IL, is seeking applications for a full-time Clinical Faculty member of the Physician Associate [PA] Studies program to begin August 1st 2026. Roosevelt has recently applied for provisional accreditation with the Accreditation Review Commission on Education for the Physician Assistant, Inc. [ARC-PA] with a planned program... View Details Bookmark Clinical Practice Professor, Didactic Education, Physician Associate Studies Program Office of the Dean,Coll of Science, Health & Pharmacy Schaumburg 06/25/2026 Full-Time Faculty Roosevelt University, College of Science, Health and Pharmacy, Schaumburg, IL, is seeking applications for a full-time Didactic Faculty member to begin September 1st, 2026. Roosevelt has recently applied for provisional accreditation with the Accreditation Review Commission on Education for the Physician Assistant, Inc. [ARC-PA] with a planned program start date in August 2028. This is an excit... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor, Criminal Justice Office of Criminal Justice & Crimin Schaumburg 06/22/2026 Adjunct Reﬂecting the ideals of its founders in 1945, Roosevelt University is a private, nonsectarian community of educators, scholars and learners committed to academic, creative and service excellence, who value differences in personal experiences and perspectives; ask difﬁcult questions; and promote mutual understanding, inclusion, social consciousness and action toward social justice. Recognizing t... View Details Bookmark Theatre History, Adjunct Interdisciplinary Conservatory Chicago 06/01/2026 Adjunct The mission of the Chicago College of Performing Arts is to graduate students seeking a career in music, education, theatre, or arts administration, who are confident, passionate, knowledgeable, and capable of functioning in the professional arena, and who are dedicated to the practice of art to serve the cause of human dignity and to effect positive change in their communities.Position Summary... 