tical role in supporting student access, success, and institutional enrollment goals.The Associate... View Details Bookmark Clinical Practice Instructor, Academic Fellow Schaumburg Office of the Dean,Coll of Science, Health & Pharmacy Schaumburg 04/23/2026 Full-Time Faculty Roosevelt University is a private, not-for-profit, institution focused on preparing pharmacist professionals to be committed, compassionate and competent members of the healthcare team providing high-quality, ethical, and empathetic patient care. The core values of the College of Science, Health, and Pharmacy reflect the Roosevelt University mission of social justice, inclusivity, and social co... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Faculty - Class Pianist/Music Director and Sub Pool Office of Theatre Conservatory Chicago 02/18/2026 Adjunct Reflecting the ideals of its founders in 1945, Roosevelt University is a private, nonsectarian community of educators, scholars and learners committed to academic, creative and service excellence, who value differences in personal experiences and perspectives; ask difficult questions; and promote mutual understanding, inclusion, social consciousness and action toward social justice. Recognizing... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor - Mathematics Mathematics Chicago 04/30/2026 Adjunct Reflecting the ideals of its founders in 1945, Roosevelt University is a private, nonsectarian community of educators, scholars and learners committed to academic, creative and service excellence, who value differences in personal experiences and perspectives; ask difficult questions; and promote mutual understanding, inclusion, social consciousness and action toward social justice. Recognizing... View Details Bookmark Part-Time Faculty--Video for Graphic Design Graphic Design Chicago 04/01/2026 10/01/2026 Adjunct Roosevelt University is seeking a skilled and creative Adjunct Instructor to teach an undergraduate video production course designed for Graphic Design majors at our partner university centers: Harper University Center in Palatine, Illinois and McHenry University Center in Woodstock, Illinois.This course introduces students to the fundamentals of video creation as a visual communication tool, i... View Details Bookmark Assistant Teaching Professor, Clinical Coordinator Nursing Nursing Chicago 11/12/2025 Full-Time Faculty The College of Sciences, Health and Pharmacy at Roosevelt University invites applications for a Non-Tenure Track Assistant Teaching Professor, Clinical Coordinator Nursing position to begin August 15, 2026. The successful candidate will be responsible for planning and organizing the nursing clinical rotations. This will include being the liaison for clinical sites and facilities, overseeing adj... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Faculty, Finance Finance & Financial Services Chicago 02/25/2026 Adjunct Reflecting the ideals of its founders in 1945, Roosevelt University is a private, nonsectarian community of educators, scholars and learners committed to academic, creative and service excellence, who value differences in personal experiences and perspectives; ask difficult questions; and promote mutual understanding, inclusion, social consciousness and action toward social justice. Recognizing... View Details Bookmark Part-Time Faculty, Sociology Office of Sociology & Anthropology Chicago 01/22/2026 Adjunct The College of Humanities, Education and Social Sciences at Roosevelt University invites applications for a part-time teaching position in Sociology. An M.A. in Sociology or related field is required, though some doctoral work is preferred.     The successful candidate will teach 1-2 courses per academic semester. The primary teaching responsibility will be one Introduction to Sociology course ... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor, Master of Arts in Theatre Directing Interdisciplinary Conservatory Chicago 02/23/2026 Adjunct Reflecting the ideals of its founders in 1945, Roosevelt University is a private, nonsectarian community of educators, scholars and learners committed to academic, creative and service excellence, who value differences in personal experiences and perspectives; ask difficult questions; and promote mutual understanding, inclusion, social consciousness and action toward social justice. Recognizing... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Faculty, Music/Theatre History Musical Theatre Chicago 10/29/2025 Adjunct Reflecting the ideals of its founders in 1945, Roosevelt University is a private, nonsectarian community of educators, scholars and learners committed to academic, creative and service excellence, who value differences in personal experiences and perspectives; ask difficult questions; and promote mutual understanding, inclusion, social consciousness and action toward social justice. Recognizing... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor – Performing Arts Administration Interdisciplinary Conservatory Chicago 10/21/2025 Adjunct Reflecting the ideals of its founders in 1945, Roosevelt University is a private, nonsectarian community of educators, scholars and learners committed to academic, creative and service excellence, who value differences in personal experiences and perspectives; ask difficult questions; and promote mutual understanding, inclusion, social consciousness and action toward social justice. Recognizing... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 Next 430 S. Michigan, Chicago, IL To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
