ege University Center in Crystal Lake.In addition to teaching experience, applicants should possess strong graphi... View Details Bookmark Part-Time Faculty in Graphic Design Graphic Design Chicago/Schaumburg 09/26/2024 05/01/2025 Adjunct The Humanities Department at Roosevelt University seeks to hire adjunct faculty for the BA in Graphic Design program at our University Campus at McHenry County College in Crystal Lake, IL. The part-time faculty member in this position will teach Graphic Design courses based in professional graphic design skills, which may include the principles and elements of graphic design, color theory, typo... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Faculty– Higher Education Leadership Office of the Dean, CHESS Remote - Chicago 09/16/2024 Adjunct Reflecting the ideals of its founders in 1945, Roosevelt University is a private, nonsectarian community of educators, scholars and learners committed to academic, creative and service excellence, who value differences in personal experiences and perspectives; ask difficult questions; and promote mutual understanding, inclusion, social consciousness and action toward social justice. Recognizing... View Details Bookmark Artist Teacher of Musical Theatre Voice – Part Time Office of Theatre Conservatory Chicago 10/14/2024 Part-Time Faculty Reflecting the ideals of its founders in 1945, Roosevelt University is a private, nonsectarian community of educators, scholars and learners committed to academic, creative and service excellence, who value differences in personal experiences and perspectives, ask difficult questions, and promote mutual understanding, inclusion, social consciousness and action toward social justice. Recognizing... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 Next 430 S. Michigan, Chicago, IL To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
