 is pivotal in ensuring smooth operations within the College, providing comprehensive administrative and communication support to the Dean, Assistant and Associate Deans, and serving as the first point of contact for fac... View Details Bookmark Executive Secretary Division of Student Affairs Chicago 09/04/2026 Clerical The Executive Secretary provides high-level administrative and operational support to the Vice Provost for Student Affairs and Dean of Students and serves as a key point of contact for the Dean of Students Office. The position supports the effective daily operation of a fast-paced, student-centered office by managing complex scheduling and correspondence, coordinating meetings and office activi... View Details Bookmark Assistant Teaching Professor, Clinical Coordinator Nursing Nursing Chicago 11/12/2025 Full-Time Faculty The College of Sciences, Health and Pharmacy at Roosevelt University invites applications for a Non-Tenure Track Assistant Teaching Professor, Clinical Coordinator Nursing position to begin August 15, 2026. The successful candidate will be responsible for planning and organizing the nursing clinical rotations. This will include being the liaison for clinical sites and facilities, overseeing adj... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 Next 430 S. Michigan, Chicago, IL To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
